cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DataGuard: corpus and replication package for Android Data Safety disclosure analysis"
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SonHaXuan/DataGuard"
abstract: >-
  Corpus, human audit annotations and replication code for analysing the gap
  between Google Play Data Safety declarations and the privacy policies of the
  same Android applications. Includes the benchmark harness, probe sets and the
  analysis scripts that regenerate the published tables.
keywords:
  - privacy policy
  - data safety label
  - Android
  - Google Play
  - disclosure consistency
  - large language models
  - inter-annotator agreement
